+turn-off the switch's drain-source voltage is at most 85 V + 0.93 V =
+85.93 V, and 82.93 V at the simulated 82 V peak. The bus capacitance with
+damping holds the pack node: 6 × 330 µF at 35 to 52 mΩ total series
+resistance, a simulated peak under 82 V and 45 mJ in 1 µH, the loop
+inductance assumed (V324, owner, 2026-10-03). Those capacitors are a stage 2
+requirement. The 600 A external path, its module and its clamp are not known:
+see [Not known](#not-known).
 
