+### Combinations
+
+The output combinations P5 returns and its critic upheld. The board supports
+these only; the coprocessor refuses a bind outside them and the OUTPUTS page
+shows the refusal (owner, 2026-09-25). The bind order is V330's (owner,
+2026-10-03): programming binds first, then ports 1 to 4 (GPIO 32, 34, 36,
+38), then the UART socket (GPIO 33), then PPM on a PWM port.
+
