+| the same with the 4 ports on plain DShot | yes | 7 of 12 state machines, 33 words |
+| 223 of the 256 mixes on ports 1 to 4, each with the socket and PPM. A port runs bidirectional DShot (B), plain DShot (P), no PIO output (N) or a programming mode (G). 68 of the 81 mixes without G bind, and 155 of the 175 with G | yes | at most 11 of 12 state machines and 81 words; all-G 11 and 69, all-N 3 and 17. The same 223 bind from every starting base of the three blocks |
